WEBVTT

00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:08.325
Honey unit, I'm home.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.826
Monique!

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:10.911
Calculon!

00:00:12.829 --> 00:00:15.165
Oh, how I wish I could believe that.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.250
You may be my evil half-brother,

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:20.087
but there's no law against
murdering the other half.

00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:25.884
All My Circuits will be
right backafter this word from...

00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:28.762
It's highly addictive.

00:00:31.139 --> 00:00:34.101
Look. It's Slurms McKenzie.

00:00:34.184 --> 00:00:36.603
He's the original party worm.

00:00:37.729 --> 00:00:39.258
Ooh.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:41.291
Whimmy wham-wham wozzle!

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:43.085
Let's party!

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:49.258
Look at that worm go.

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:51.426
Who says there are no more heroes?

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.680
Hey, dudes, you could win a chance

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.890
to party with me, Slurms McKenzie

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:59.810
at the Slurm bottling plant
on Planet Wormulon.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.272
Just look for the golden bottle
capinside specially marked cans of slurm.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:06.233
I won.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.443
No purchase necessary
unless you wish to enter.

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:10.070
Odds of winning insignificant.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.572
I like those odds.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.075
Rats.

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.618
Just another tooth.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.751
Ah...

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.374
I got to find that golden bottle cap.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:10.047
I've never seen anyone
so addicted to slurm.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.965
This is nothing. Back in high school

00:02:12.049 --> 00:02:14.343
I used to drink
a hundred cans of cola a week.

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:16.386
Right up until my third heart attack.

00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:20.390
Bender, what's wrong?

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:21.475
I'm sick.

00:02:23.477 --> 00:02:26.563
You poor baby.
Let me check if you have a fever.

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:28.023
Ow!

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.319
According to Bender's temperature gauge,

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:35.113
WHICH I SUGGEST YOU USE NEXT TIME, LEELA,

00:02:35.197 --> 00:02:38.575
he's running a fever of... 900 degrees.

00:02:40.953 --> 00:02:43.163
Bender, mon, lie yourself down.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.417
You're paying for that.

00:02:47.835 --> 00:02:50.087
I'll have a look but I remind you

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.631
I'm an expert on humans, not robots.

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.883
I'm not Bender. I'm Fry.

00:02:54.967 --> 00:02:57.886
Really? I thought you were the robot.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.179
Nope, human.

00:02:59.263 --> 00:03:02.516
All right, all right,
spare me your life story.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.726
Now, what seems to be the trouble?

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:08.939
My tummy hurts and I've been having
this burning electrical discharge.

00:03:09.565 --> 00:03:10.691
Hmm.

00:03:10.774 --> 00:03:12.776
Don't worry, you'll be fine.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.194
Oh, boy.

00:03:14.945 --> 00:03:18.657
I didn't have the heart to tell him
it's fin fungus.

00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:21.076
He'll be floating upside down by morning.

00:03:22.911 --> 00:03:25.581
You should try
homeopathic medicine, Bender.

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:26.707
Take some zinc.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.375
I'm 40% zinc.

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:31.128
Then take some echinacea
or St. John's wort.

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.046
Or a big, fat placebo.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.590
It's all the same crap.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:37.801
Hey, what's rattling around in there?

00:03:37.885 --> 00:03:40.470
It may well be
the cause of Bender's illness

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:41.638
But more importantly,

00:03:41.722 --> 00:03:44.766
it's a flimsy pretext
to try out my latest invention.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.643
To the laboratory.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.860
I call this the F-ray.

00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:59.323
It's like an X-ray, only it allows you
to see through anything... even metal.

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:02.826
Now, the neutrino beam it emits
is a tad dangerous,

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.953
so you'll need protective goggles.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.915
Huh?

00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:15.380
You may feel a slight stinging sensation.

00:04:15.631 --> 00:04:16.632
All of you.

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:25.891
Aha!

00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:28.143
There's the cause of your illness.

00:04:28.227 --> 00:04:29.728
Hey, that's my watch.

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:31.522
I was wondering where I put that.

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:38.445
Hey! Now I feel much better.

00:04:38.529 --> 00:04:39.613
Thanks, Professor.

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:42.449
And Amy... sorry I took your watch.

00:04:49.206 --> 00:04:52.417
Well, I've got to go take this suit
to the decontaminators.

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:54.336
You two lock up the F-ray,

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:58.632
and for the love of God
don't let it fall into the wrong hands.

00:05:08.559 --> 00:05:10.227
What shall we point it at first?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.020
I don't know. Try it on me.

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:13.146
Ow!

00:05:13.272 --> 00:05:14.273
My sperm.

00:05:14.439 --> 00:05:17.150
Wow! Neat. Mind if I try that again?

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:20.320
Huh. Didn't hurt that time.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.615
Oh, mama.

00:05:23.699 --> 00:05:25.617
Hold still, sexy lady.

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:30.247
- What's wrong?
- That's no lady.

00:05:30.622 --> 00:05:31.832
Damn, chico.

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:34.501
One more upgrade and I'll be more lady
than you can handle.

00:05:34.585 --> 00:05:36.378
Why you so stupid, stupid?

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:38.755
Hey, bite my shiny metal ass.

00:05:38.839 --> 00:05:40.424
You couldn't afford it, honey.

00:05:45.387 --> 00:05:49.600
Man, all this prolonged exposure
to radiation is making me thirsty.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.438
Ah! If only there was some way of knowing

00:05:54.521 --> 00:05:57.316
which can had
the winning bottle cap inside.

00:05:57.399 --> 00:05:59.359
What? I didn't hear you.

00:05:59.443 --> 00:06:02.362
I was too busy using this F-ray
to look inside of things.

00:06:02.446 --> 00:06:03.989
Wait a second.

00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:05.073
I'm getting an idea.

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:07.284
No. False alarm.

00:06:07.576 --> 00:06:10.037
No, yeah, no, yeah, no. Wait.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:13.207
No, yeah, yeah. No. No. Yes!

00:06:36.188 --> 00:06:37.189
Sorry.

00:06:40.192 --> 00:06:41.485
This thing stinks.

00:06:41.568 --> 00:06:45.030
We checked 90,000 cans of slurm
and all we won was this junk.

00:06:46.323 --> 00:06:48.659
I never want to see
another can of slurm again.

00:06:48.742 --> 00:06:50.244
Man, am I thirsty.

00:06:56.708 --> 00:06:58.168
Fry, are you all right?

00:07:00.087 --> 00:07:01.255
You did it, Fry!

00:07:01.338 --> 00:07:03.507
You found the winning bottle cap.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:04.758
We won!

00:07:24.945 --> 00:07:25.946
Hey.

00:07:30.993 --> 00:07:33.203
- Ooh.
- Wow.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.415
Welcome to the Planet Wormulon.

00:07:36.498 --> 00:07:41.670
I'm Glurmo your gollyrific guide
to the splentacular slurm factory.

00:07:41.837 --> 00:07:43.714
Uh-huh. Can we have our free slurm now?

00:07:43.797 --> 00:07:46.550
You'll have all the slurm
you can drink later on

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:51.388
when you're partying with my
good friend Slurms McKenzie!

00:07:53.557 --> 00:07:55.017
All right!

00:07:56.685 --> 00:07:58.687
Lay some skin on me, dudes.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:00.480
Wow!

00:08:00.564 --> 00:08:02.649
The original party worm.

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:05.194
Are you ready to get down,
get funky with us?

00:08:05.277 --> 00:08:08.780
He'd better be.
That's what we pay him for, right, Slurms?

00:08:08.864 --> 00:08:09.990
Right!

00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:13.243
In fact, Slurms has to party all night,
every night,

00:08:13.327 --> 00:08:14.411
or he's fired.

00:08:14.786 --> 00:08:15.913
Rock on.

00:08:15.996 --> 00:08:17.414
But before the party,

00:08:17.497 --> 00:08:19.833
you're all in for a funderful treat.

00:08:19.917 --> 00:08:23.337
A V.I.P. tour of the slurm factory.

00:08:25.172 --> 00:08:26.882
Enjoy the tour, dudes.

00:08:27.674 --> 00:08:29.134
I'm going to go lie down.

00:08:30.886 --> 00:08:32.262
Welcome, my friends

00:08:32.346 --> 00:08:35.390
to the wondrous world of whimsy
that we like to call

00:08:35.682 --> 00:08:40.103
Slurm Centralized
Industrial Fabrication Unit.

00:08:42.856 --> 00:08:44.107
Oh, my.

00:08:44.274 --> 00:08:47.194
Look, flowers, and a boat.

00:08:53.742 --> 00:08:56.787
Who are those horrible
orange creatures over there?

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:59.039
Why, those are the grunka-lunkas.

00:08:59.122 --> 00:09:01.500
They work here in the slurm factory.

00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:03.168
Tell them I hate them.

00:09:03.252 --> 00:09:05.629
As we sail down
the river of slurm,

00:09:05.712 --> 00:09:08.048
you'll see our mixologists at work.

00:09:08.173 --> 00:09:11.426
They take 900 of the finest ingredients,

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.096
add a touch of childlike delight,

00:09:14.179 --> 00:09:16.932
and mix it all with glacial spring water

00:09:17.015 --> 00:09:19.560
from our glacial spring water generator.

00:09:22.187 --> 00:09:25.774
Then, last of all,
we add the secret ingredient

00:09:25.858 --> 00:09:29.152
that makes slurm so deliciously addictive.

00:09:31.989 --> 00:09:33.657
So, what's the secret ingredient?

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.243
It's whatever
your imagination wants it to be.

00:09:36.451 --> 00:09:38.370
Oh. But what is it, really?

00:09:38.453 --> 00:09:40.664
That's not for you to know.

00:09:41.164 --> 00:09:43.500
Now, over here, the grunka-lunkas

00:09:43.584 --> 00:09:46.753
are inducing wumpus berries
to release their flavor

00:09:46.837 --> 00:09:49.548
using sensual massage.

00:09:50.632 --> 00:09:52.259
Psst. Those berries.

00:09:52.342 --> 00:09:54.845
- Those are the secret ingredient, right?
- No.

00:09:54.928 --> 00:09:56.638
- You positive?
- Yes.

00:09:56.722 --> 00:09:58.932
I'm just asking
'cause they look kind of secret.

00:09:59.016 --> 00:10:00.017
Enough!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.102
There will be no further questions.

00:10:02.186 --> 00:10:04.146
- Why?
- Hey, look.

00:10:04.354 --> 00:10:06.607
The disgusting little men
are starting to sing.

00:10:09.776 --> 00:10:12.571
Grunka lunka dunkity doo

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:15.532
We've got a friendly warning for you

00:10:15.616 --> 00:10:18.368
Grunka lunka dunkity dasis

00:10:18.452 --> 00:10:21.413
The secret of slurm's
On a need-to-know basis

00:10:22.581 --> 00:10:24.166
Asking questions in school

00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:25.626
Is a great way to learn

00:10:25.709 --> 00:10:28.629
If you try that stuff here
You might get your legs broke

00:10:28.712 --> 00:10:31.340
We once found a dead guy
Face-down in the slurm

00:10:31.423 --> 00:10:34.301
It could easily happen again to you, folks

00:10:34.384 --> 00:10:37.513
So keep your head down
And keep your mouth shut

00:10:37.596 --> 00:10:41.225
Grunka lunka lunka dunkity dutt!

00:10:41.308 --> 00:10:43.810
Hey! I don't pay you to sing.

00:10:43.894 --> 00:10:46.313
You just used up today's bathroom break.

00:10:46.396 --> 00:10:47.564
Hardass.

00:10:47.648 --> 00:10:49.191
I heard that.

00:10:50.526 --> 00:10:51.902
Now, on your right

00:10:51.985 --> 00:10:53.779
you'll see the Slurm Master

00:10:53.862 --> 00:10:56.740
checking the slurm for color and bouquet.

00:10:58.575 --> 00:10:59.826
So thirsty...

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.703
Then he tastes it.

00:11:01.787 --> 00:11:05.123
He tastes it, and tastes it,
then tastes it some more.

00:11:06.291 --> 00:11:07.918
Could I have some slurm, please?

00:11:08.001 --> 00:11:10.254
No food or drink allowed on the tour.

00:11:10.337 --> 00:11:13.507
You'll have to wait till you're
partying with Slurms McKenzie.

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:14.633
When will that be?

00:11:14.716 --> 00:11:15.717
Soon enough.

00:11:15.801 --> 00:11:17.261
That's not soon enough.

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:18.804
Hey, what's behind that door?

00:11:19.638 --> 00:11:22.015
- Nothing.
- Is it the secret ingredient?

00:11:22.099 --> 00:11:24.893
Grunka lunka dunkity dingredient

00:11:24.977 --> 00:11:27.271
You should not ask
About the secret ingredient

00:11:27.354 --> 00:11:29.773
Okay, okay, we get the point.

00:11:30.107 --> 00:11:32.568
I was just curious
because of the armed guards.

00:11:32.651 --> 00:11:35.404
Grunka lunka dunkity darmed-guards

00:11:35.487 --> 00:11:36.780
Shut the hell up!

00:11:41.326 --> 00:11:43.745
So you're telling me
I could fire my whole staff

00:11:43.829 --> 00:11:46.039
and hire grunka-lunkas at half the cost?

00:11:46.123 --> 00:11:47.249
That's right.

00:11:47.332 --> 00:11:49.793
They think they have a good union,
but they don't.

00:11:50.043 --> 00:11:51.753
They're basically slaves.

00:11:58.594 --> 00:12:00.179
What are you doing?

00:12:00.262 --> 00:12:01.680
I'm dying of thirst.

00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:03.974
Grab my feet and dunk my head in
so I can drink.

00:12:04.057 --> 00:12:05.601
No. That's moronic.

00:12:05.684 --> 00:12:08.061
Fine. I'll let go,
and swim around in the slurm,

00:12:08.145 --> 00:12:09.897
and drink as much as I want.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.233
Help! I can't swim!

00:12:13.859 --> 00:12:15.777
Oh...

00:12:28.081 --> 00:12:29.750
Bender, why did you jump in?

00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:31.335
Everybody was doing it.

00:12:31.418 --> 00:12:33.003
I just wanted to be popular.

00:12:40.719 --> 00:12:42.804
- Ow!
- Where are we?

00:12:42.888 --> 00:12:46.350
And why is the slurm
pouring into this sewer?

00:12:49.853 --> 00:12:51.647
This isn't slurm at all.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.942
Something's rotten on the Planet Wormulan.
Look at this.

00:13:03.742 --> 00:13:06.912
This all must have something to do
with the secret ingredient.

00:13:06.995 --> 00:13:08.163
My God!

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.083
What if the secret ingredient is people?

00:13:11.166 --> 00:13:14.753
No. There's already a soda like that.
Soylent cola.

00:13:14.962 --> 00:13:16.588
Oh. How is it?

00:13:16.672 --> 00:13:18.715
It varies from person to person.

00:13:18.799 --> 00:13:21.635
Ooh! Hmm.

00:13:26.139 --> 00:13:29.101
Do you have any that aren't
so tight around the thorax?

00:13:29.184 --> 00:13:30.811
Yes. Over in...

00:13:30.978 --> 00:13:33.772
Say, weren't there
more people in your group

00:13:33.856 --> 00:13:35.274
at the start of the tour?

00:13:35.357 --> 00:13:36.692
Hey, yeah.

00:13:36.775 --> 00:13:38.652
Fry, Leela, and Bender are missing.

00:13:39.319 --> 00:13:41.113
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:50.998 --> 00:13:52.332
Quick!

00:13:58.589 --> 00:14:00.674
- Phew!
- Look. Slurm!

00:14:00.757 --> 00:14:01.758
Finally.

00:14:07.097 --> 00:14:08.098
Oh, yeah.

00:14:08.182 --> 00:14:10.726
I'm never going 12 minutes
without a slurm again.

00:14:10.809 --> 00:14:12.269
It's the end of the line.

00:14:12.352 --> 00:14:14.646
This must be where they put in
the secret ingredient.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.399
Whatever it is, it's even better fresh.

00:14:18.984 --> 00:14:19.985
Still warm.

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:31.663
- Ohh!
- Yack!

00:14:31.747 --> 00:14:33.040
Oh! Lordy!

00:14:34.666 --> 00:14:35.959
Fry!

00:14:37.836 --> 00:14:38.879
Whew!

00:14:40.714 --> 00:14:41.715
Fry!

00:14:48.597 --> 00:14:50.724
That's the secret ingredient of slurm?

00:14:50.807 --> 00:14:53.227
That's the only ingredient of slurm.

00:14:53.393 --> 00:14:54.853
Eww-hoo-hoo!

00:15:00.734 --> 00:15:01.902
Whoa!

00:15:06.365 --> 00:15:07.407
Aw!

00:15:14.248 --> 00:15:15.624
I'll save us!

00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:18.085
Yah!

00:15:18.418 --> 00:15:19.878
Oh! That feels good.

00:15:20.546 --> 00:15:21.547
Yep.

00:15:22.214 --> 00:15:23.340
Thanks, Bender.

00:15:27.678 --> 00:15:29.179
The exit. We made it!

00:15:32.099 --> 00:15:34.601
Your Majesty, I brought the prisoners.

00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:39.565
Well, my curious friends,
you learned the secret of slurm.

00:15:39.648 --> 00:15:43.026
That concludes the portion of the tour
where you stay alive.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.654
You wish, you slimy worm.

00:15:45.737 --> 00:15:47.030
Hi-yah!

00:15:51.869 --> 00:15:52.953
Oh!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.580
Good work, Glurmo.

00:15:54.663 --> 00:15:56.456
You have pleased your Queen.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.958
THANK YOU, YOUR MAJESTY.

00:15:58.041 --> 00:15:59.209
Thanks, ma'am.

00:15:59.293 --> 00:16:00.294
How can you trick people

00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:02.796
into drinking something
that comes out of your behind?

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.173
It's disgusting.

00:16:04.256 --> 00:16:07.885
Is it? Honey comes from a bee's behind.

00:16:07.968 --> 00:16:10.387
Milk comes from a cow's behind.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.306
And have you ever used toothpaste?

00:16:12.389 --> 00:16:13.891
Whose behind does that come from?

00:16:13.974 --> 00:16:15.184
You don't want to know.

00:16:15.267 --> 00:16:18.270
Look, we just came to party
with Slurms McKenzie.

00:16:18.353 --> 00:16:19.938
By the way, when is that scheduled?

00:16:20.022 --> 00:16:21.231
Never!

00:16:21.899 --> 00:16:23.692
To the torture cave!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:31.450
You, my metal friend, will have the honor

00:16:31.533 --> 00:16:34.786
of becoming 174 slurm cans.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.539
This trip is turning into a big letdown.

00:16:37.623 --> 00:16:39.833
As for you, you will be submerged

00:16:39.917 --> 00:16:42.669
in royal slurm,
which, in a matter of minutes

00:16:42.753 --> 00:16:45.756
will transform you into
a slurm queen like myself.

00:16:45.839 --> 00:16:47.966
But, your highness, she's a commoner.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.760
Her slurm will taste foul.

00:16:49.843 --> 00:16:53.764
Yes! Which is why we'll market it
as "new slurm."

00:16:53.847 --> 00:16:57.351
Then, when everyone hates it,
we'll bring back slurm classic

00:16:57.434 --> 00:16:58.894
and make billions.

00:17:03.565 --> 00:17:05.150
Oh... Oh.

00:17:05.275 --> 00:17:06.276
What about me?

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:08.820
- You are free to go.
- Yes!

00:17:08.904 --> 00:17:12.282
If you can resist this
concentrated superslurm.

00:17:13.116 --> 00:17:14.117
Whoa!

00:17:18.872 --> 00:17:20.457
It's so delicious

00:17:20.624 --> 00:17:22.626
You'll eat until you explode.

00:17:22.709 --> 00:17:25.420
Which reminds me,
put a top over that sofa, would you?

00:17:25.587 --> 00:17:27.339
Bon appétit.

00:17:30.759 --> 00:17:31.969
Mmm...

00:17:32.052 --> 00:17:33.428
Farewell.

00:17:33.971 --> 00:17:36.890
Oh. And congratulations again
on winning the contest.

00:17:40.352 --> 00:17:41.937
Fry, untie us. Quick.

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.230
Here I come.

00:17:43.522 --> 00:17:45.357
Let me just... one more taste.

00:17:48.277 --> 00:17:49.403
You pig.

00:17:49.486 --> 00:17:51.822
Stop stuffing your craw and save us.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.830
I can't see what's happening.

00:17:59.913 --> 00:18:01.123
Are we boned?

00:18:01.206 --> 00:18:02.499
Yeah, we're boned.

00:18:09.298 --> 00:18:11.800
I can't stop eating this delicious ooze,

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.844
but I'm not going to let you die.

00:18:17.347 --> 00:18:18.390
Hurry.

00:18:18.473 --> 00:18:19.474
What's happening?

00:18:20.851 --> 00:18:22.019
Oh.

00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:28.483
Whew!

00:18:28.901 --> 00:18:31.320
Just in time.

00:18:38.327 --> 00:18:40.370
No!

00:18:42.915 --> 00:18:45.459
I could fit if I didn't have
these damn arms.

00:18:51.882 --> 00:18:55.677
We're close to the exit.
I can smell those filthy orange guys.

00:18:55.761 --> 00:18:57.095
Stop right there!

00:18:57.179 --> 00:18:59.097
Slurms McKenzie!

00:18:59.264 --> 00:19:02.017
Shh! I want you to take me with you.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.061
- Say what?
- I'm partied out.

00:19:04.144 --> 00:19:07.856
All I want is to stay home and rent videos
and watch them with a few friends.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.191
Is that so much to ask?

00:19:09.274 --> 00:19:10.692
Forget it, pal.

00:19:10.776 --> 00:19:13.862
It says on this bottle cap
you have to party with us.

00:19:13.946 --> 00:19:15.989
All right, when we get to earth.

00:19:16.073 --> 00:19:19.076
But please, don't invite too many people.
I want to keep it small.

00:19:19.159 --> 00:19:21.119
No can do, Slurms.

00:19:21.286 --> 00:19:22.955
Huh?

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.461
This way!

00:19:30.504 --> 00:19:31.588
Oh! Oh!

00:19:40.806 --> 00:19:42.057
She's gaining on us.

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:44.226
Go on without me. I'll hold her off.

00:19:44.309 --> 00:19:46.061
But she'll crush you like a worm...

00:19:46.144 --> 00:19:47.354
Crushing a smaller worm.

00:19:47.437 --> 00:19:48.772
It's all right.

00:19:49.106 --> 00:19:52.693
I'm so tired of partying, so very tired.

00:19:54.278 --> 00:19:57.573
I'll save you the only way I know how.
By partying!

00:19:59.241 --> 00:20:01.159
- Babes?
- Yes, Mr. McKenzie?

00:20:01.243 --> 00:20:05.581
You've served me well these 40 years,
but this time, I've got to party alone.

00:20:05.664 --> 00:20:07.833
- But...
- There'll be other parties for you.

00:20:07.916 --> 00:20:09.793
Now go. Go.

00:20:16.258 --> 00:20:18.343
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:20:19.761 --> 00:20:21.388
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:23.807
Party on, Slurms.

00:20:24.391 --> 00:20:26.518
Party on, contest winners.

00:20:27.186 --> 00:20:28.312
Party on.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.277
No! We're ruined!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:38.071
They know our disgusting secret!

00:20:39.698 --> 00:20:40.949
No!

00:20:47.581 --> 00:20:50.709
Commissioner, my crew has made
a horrific discovery.

00:20:50.792 --> 00:20:55.547
It seems that slurm is produced
in a colossal worm heinie.

00:20:56.423 --> 00:20:59.176
Hmm. "Heinie," you say?
Why, with your testimony

00:20:59.259 --> 00:21:02.387
we'll finally be able
to outlaw this insidious slurm.

00:21:02.471 --> 00:21:03.805
Outlaw slurm?

00:21:05.098 --> 00:21:06.600
Don't pay any attention to him, sir.

00:21:06.683 --> 00:21:09.061
Grandpa's making up crazy stories again.

00:21:09.144 --> 00:21:10.562
I'm not your grandpa.

00:21:10.646 --> 00:21:13.649
You're my uncle. From the year 2000!

00:21:14.399 --> 00:21:18.529
Okay, Grandpa,
we'll take care of the "bad worms."

00:21:18.612 --> 00:21:19.863
Don't you worry.

00:21:22.699 --> 00:21:25.994
I just wish Slurms McKenzie
were here to enjoy this with me.

00:21:26.078 --> 00:21:28.914
Yeah, that Slurms sure loved to party.

00:21:28.997 --> 00:21:32.918
What do you say we all party
one last time for him?

00:21:33.001 --> 00:21:34.419
For Slurms.

00:21:34.503 --> 00:21:35.712
- For slurms.
- For slurms.

00:21:35.796 --> 00:21:36.922
Whammy wozzle.

00:21:41.844 --> 00:21:43.637
Hey, that's not that bad.

00:21:49.309 --> 00:21:50.978
Mmm!